NOTICE
======

This notice comes with the files of the Verilog runtime (the "runtime"): a WebAssembly build of
Icarus Verilog (ivlpp, ivl and vvp), a JavaScript driver, and small Web Worker files, published by
Cresmaia Inc. (株式会社クレスマイア) in the repository cresmaia/verilog-web-runtime.

The words "this release" mean the files listed in
index.html of the release directory (/<version>/). Components that are not in this release are not listed here.
The Yosys bundle (yosys-wasm/), in a release that has it, has its own notice (yosys-wasm/NOTICE).

No part of the runtime is guaranteed to work or to be fit for any purpose. See "1. Warranty" below.

